{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_02_domain_model_s1_1a", "label": "02 \u00a71.1a \u2014 Epistemic vs control actions, acceptance by a different principal", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_s4", "label": "06 \u00a74 \u2014 Display rules", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_10_agent_handoff_invariant_3", "label": "Invariant 3 \u2014 Append-only; corrections are new contributions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "label": "Stage 19 \u2014 Correct what is recorded, from a connector (implemented)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every primitive already existed in the log (SUPERSEDE_CLAIM, MERGE_CLAIMS, SUPERSEDE_LINK, ACCEPT, tasks); none was reachable from a connector and the website had no way to accept a proposal, so a correction proposed by anyone but the claim's own principal waited forever. Nothing is deleted; invalidation stays with human audits."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_six_tools", "label": "revise_claim, merge_claims, revise_link, open_task, list_proposals, accept_proposal", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Own work is fixed at once and someone else's becomes a proposal that says whose acceptance it waits for; an assistant must never claim something was fixed when it is a proposal. carry_links re-issues every counted link onto the corrected claim, signed by whoever affirms the new text \u2014 the reviser for own work, the acceptor for a proposal."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_acceptance_scope", "label": "Connector acceptance scope, stricter than the applier's", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The applier admits any different principal; the connector and the claim page admit only the target's own principal, any named principal when the target's is anonymous, or a moderator. Declining is leaving a proposal pending \u2014 there is no REJECT \u2014 and proposals do not expire (both reserved)."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_share_line", "label": "The share line \u2014 one line a person can paste", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "record_investigation takes the exact statement the person wanted checked and creates an Investigation row \u2014 an index over log content, like receipts \u2014 with a public page and a 1200x630 PNG. The probability appears only in the permitted form (\"0.9800 under ledger-default@0.1.0 at snapshot 412\"); \"accurate\" and \"% true\" are refused because Article XXII forbids presenting a computed probability as a property of reality."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_whole_statement", "label": "The whole statement rule and Investigations::Verdict", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A five-claim meme came back as a two-claim check page because the assistant recorded only the new claims. Every claim a statement makes now goes into one record call, existing ones by reference, opinions as NORMATIVE. The verdict is display composition read from the claims' states \u2014 never a percentage, never a change to a claim score."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_validity_badges", "label": "Validity badges on the check page (departure from 06 \u00a74 rule 12)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rule 12 forbids colour-coding claims; the owner chose ten green-to-red SVG badges for the page people paste into social media, and they appear nowhere else \u2014 claim pages, cards and the API stay neutral. The labels keep evidence wording rather than \"true\" or \"false\", which Article XXII rules out. 06 \u00a74 rule 12 should be revised by the owner to name this exception."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_guidance_in_results", "label": "Guidance in results, not in tool descriptions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hosts cache the tool list from the moment of connection, so rule text in descriptions goes stale until a person reconnects, while results are read fresh on every call. Tool names and input schemas are treated as an interface: additive and batched, since only those need a reconnect. tools/list_changed is not sent: it needs a streaming channel Galedra does not serve and would not refresh a host's stored catalog anyway."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_request_feature", "label": "request_feature \u2014 assistants can say what they could not do", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Recorded in the assistant's own words at the moment it fell short. The rows live outside the log because they are untrusted text; repeats within 30 days are counted on one row, ten a day per assistant, and only moderators see them. The assistant is told it can at three points: the tool list, a hint on every refusal, and the guidance on every result."}], "edges": [{"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_six_tools", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_acceptance_scope", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_share_line", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_whole_statement", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_validity_badges", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_guidance_in_results", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_request_feature", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_six_tools", "target": "app_services_corrections_corrections", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_six_tools", "target": "app_services_ui_write_write", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_acceptance_scope", "target": "app_services_corrections_corrections", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_six_tools", "target": "app_services_tasks_lease_lease", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_share_line", "target": "app_models_investigation_investigation", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_whole_statement", "target": "app_services_investigations_verdict_verdict", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_validity_badges", "target": "app_services_cards_badge_badge", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_request_feature", "target": "app_models_feature_request_featurerequest", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_02_domain_model_s1_1a", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_10_agent_handoff_invariant_3", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_validity_badges", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_06_api_and_ui_s4", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_guidance_in_results", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_31_guidance_on_the_wire_stage", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_stage", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-19-corrections.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}